## More emission-line stars {#emission-candidates}

We ran the same hydrogen-line test, unchanged, on [[e23s.e23_candidates_measured]] more stars that Gaia flags as likely Be or T Tauri stars. [[e23s.e23_N_total]] of [[e23s.e23_M_total]] that could be measured show line emission, against [[e23s.e23_control_fp]] of [[e23s.e23_control_testable]] ordinary stars. For [[e23s.e23_n_no_published_emission_classification_found]] we found no published emission-line classification; they are candidates that need a spectrum to confirm.

