Each of these is a candidate, not a confirmed object. Each needs a spectrum or another observation.

- [[deriveds.e22_vet_keep]] cold brown dwarfs with methane measured ([section](#methane-candidates), [CSV](products/epoch_methane_candidates.csv), column `vet_verdict` = KEEP).
- [[e23s.e23_n_no_published_emission_classification_found]] possible emission-line stars with no published classification ([section](#emission-candidates), [CSV](products/epoch_emission_line_candidates.csv)).
- North ecliptic pole: [[e33s.n_tested]] variables missing from the catalogues were checked and [[e33s.n_survivors]] survive ([section](#e18), [CSV](products/epoch_nep_variable_candidates.csv)).

